== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Ulv|Aggressive creature strategies#Ulv}}

=== Bite ===
Crouches down before swinging up to bite the player (80 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This extends 2.2 meters in a 25-degree horizontal arc and can be used every 5 seconds when within 1.5 meters of a player.

=== Slash ===
Steps back before lifting both paws to slash downward (70 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). It has a vertical hitbox that hits 2.5 meters out and spans 60 degrees. This has a 9-second cooldown and can be used within 3 meters of a player.

